+@echo off
+rem ============================================================
+rem  A-1 decision study v0.5 : start the oTree dev server (Windows)
+rem  Double-click this file. See README.md section "動かし方".
+rem
+rem  1. copies the project to %LOCALAPPDATA%\a1-decision-study_v0.5
